"You can assign between %llu and %llu GB of memory to this Virtual Mac, with %llu GB as the recommendation. The remaining memory is used for graphics processing and iPadOS.\n\nMaxing out memory assignment does not guarantee improved performance in Virtual Mac, and may degrade graphics performance and system stability." = "你可以為此虛擬Mac分配%llu至%lluGB記憶體，建議分配%lluGB。其餘記憶體將用於圖像處理和iPadOS。\n\n將記憶體分配至上限並不一定能提升虛擬Mac的效能，反而可能降低圖像效能和系統穩定性。";
